WEBVTT

01:37.580 --> 01:42.970
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.330 --> 01:46.009
[Episode 24]

01:46.150 --> 01:49.479
I'd rather spend the rest of my life
in a temple

01:49.840 --> 01:51.900
than be forced to become a concubine!

01:56.950 --> 01:58.410
This is a joyous occasion.

01:58.590 --> 01:59.680
Don't be insolent.

02:00.920 --> 02:02.120
Listen up, all of you!

02:02.680 --> 02:03.640
I, Xie Qingyuan,

02:03.760 --> 02:06.200
hereby call off my marriage to Li Congxin,
the Heir

02:06.200 --> 02:07.660
of the Marquis of Danyang!

02:11.800 --> 02:12.840
I will not marry him!

02:12.840 --> 02:13.440
Qingyuan.

02:14.520 --> 02:15.080
Fourth Sister.

02:15.080 --> 02:16.210
You rebellious son!

02:18.710 --> 02:19.560
Father.

02:20.310 --> 02:21.000
Father.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.360
Kneel!

02:24.910 --> 02:25.710
Father!

02:25.960 --> 02:27.360
Nanny Liu.

02:27.430 --> 02:28.280
Father.

02:34.870 --> 02:35.630
Fourth Lady.

02:36.310 --> 02:37.170
Don't touch me!

02:37.360 --> 02:38.030
Let go of me!

02:38.120 --> 02:38.750
Let go of me!

02:38.750 --> 02:39.630
Fourth Lady,

02:39.960 --> 02:41.560
a concubine like you
can't wear bridal robes.

02:41.560 --> 02:44.310
This attire of yours is more dignified
than even the principal wife's.

02:44.310 --> 02:46.150
This servant will teach you a lesson

02:46.150 --> 02:48.150
and rid you of any notion
that you can overstep your station,

02:48.150 --> 02:50.520
lest you enter the Marquis's household
without knowing your place!

02:50.520 --> 02:51.280
Let go of me.

02:51.470 --> 02:53.000
Who do you think you are?

02:53.000 --> 02:53.750
Let go of me!

02:56.150 --> 02:56.910
Let go of me!

02:57.360 --> 02:59.560
How dare you try to
vie with our Second Lady?

02:59.560 --> 03:01.290
I'd say you've got a death wish!

03:09.960 --> 03:10.630
Let go of me!

03:40.079 --> 03:41.240
Fourth Lady,

03:42.280 --> 03:44.270
this servant still remembers

03:44.680 --> 03:47.240
those 30 slaps quite vividly.

03:56.190 --> 03:56.800
Let's go.

04:12.430 --> 04:13.360
Get away from me!

04:13.470 --> 04:14.310
Get away from me!

04:14.310 --> 04:15.000
-Qingyuan!
-Chunzhi!

04:15.000 --> 04:16.860
Don't come any closer, all of you!

04:18.720 --> 04:20.120
Whoever dares come near,

04:20.510 --> 04:22.630
I'll pierce a hole in your neck!

04:52.190 --> 04:53.510
-Move!
-Out of the way!

05:19.310 --> 05:23.640
♪ I counted every moment ♪

05:23.710 --> 05:27.800
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

05:27.820 --> 05:32.030
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

05:32.060 --> 05:36.440
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

05:36.460 --> 05:41.130
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

05:38.600 --> 05:39.200
Qingyuan.

05:41.150 --> 05:45.590
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

05:45.620 --> 05:52.270
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

05:52.120 --> 05:53.000
What are you doing here?

05:52.300 --> 05:55.940
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

05:55.960 --> 06:01.560
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

06:00.240 --> 06:00.900
Commander,

06:01.580 --> 06:05.820
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

06:01.680 --> 06:04.120
you've barged into
the Marquis's wedding hall,

06:04.120 --> 06:06.240
and now you're embracing
the Heir's concubine.

06:05.860 --> 06:10.220
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

06:06.630 --> 06:09.070
Isn't this rather improper?

06:09.630 --> 06:11.070
Your family and Li family

06:10.240 --> 06:14.700
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

06:11.750 --> 06:13.950
are willing to let such a gem be sullied.

06:14.000 --> 06:14.870
But I

06:14.720 --> 06:18.950
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

06:15.000 --> 06:18.040
cannot bear to see the woman I love
reduced to a concubine.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.310
The woman you love?

06:18.980 --> 06:23.540
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

06:19.680 --> 06:22.270
Commander, surely you're not trying to

06:22.680 --> 06:24.270
snatch her in front of everyone?

06:23.570 --> 06:27.880
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

06:25.040 --> 06:26.680
You speak too gravely, Lord Xie.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.920
This isn't seizing her.

06:27.910 --> 06:33.659
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

06:28.800 --> 06:30.800
I'm asking for her hand in marriage.

07:04.910 --> 07:11.800
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

07:11.830 --> 07:19.070
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

07:19.090 --> 07:22.450
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

07:22.480 --> 07:26.180
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

07:26.200 --> 07:33.050
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

07:28.920 --> 07:29.510
Son.

07:30.000 --> 07:30.600
Chunzhi.

07:33.120 --> 07:40.480
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

07:40.500 --> 07:47.510
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

07:47.570 --> 07:51.380
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

07:50.560 --> 07:52.040
I offer this red cloak
as your wedding robe

07:51.440 --> 07:54.870
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

07:52.560 --> 07:53.950
and ask you

07:54.680 --> 07:55.920
to become my wife.

07:54.930 --> 08:02.280
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

07:58.040 --> 08:00.360
Offering the red wedding robe is a rite
for a woman marrying beneath her station.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.270
Commander,

08:01.750 --> 08:03.510
you're lowering your status.

08:02.310 --> 08:08.950
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

08:07.510 --> 08:09.000
Amid the flames of calamity,
fate entrusted you to me;

08:08.970 --> 08:16.220
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

08:09.310 --> 08:11.480
Once, before the Buddha,
our incense rose as one.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.950
By the windy window,
we revisit old promises;

08:12.950 --> 08:14.870
Counting worn silver,
awaiting our coming spring.

08:14.870 --> 08:16.870
May parted stars shine together once more,
defying Heaven's decree;

08:16.240 --> 08:19.950
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

08:17.720 --> 08:19.920
May broken jade be made whole again,
beyond what mortals can foresee.

08:19.920 --> 08:21.070
With reverence,
I make this vow before your spirit.

08:19.980 --> 08:23.400
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

08:21.070 --> 08:22.480
Let peach blossoms
bear witness to our oath.

08:22.480 --> 08:24.240
Long ago, our hearts
were woven into silken gauze.

08:24.190 --> 08:30.530
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

08:24.360 --> 08:26.680
I have carved our promise into stone
and sealed it in wood,

08:26.680 --> 08:28.750
thus keeping the vow we made as youths
beneath the locust tree.

08:28.750 --> 08:29.870
I have sought an auspicious match

08:29.870 --> 08:30.950
and now pledge to
nurture our bond forever.

08:30.590 --> 08:38.240
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

08:31.160 --> 08:32.630
With six gifts of betrothal,
I come before your hall.

08:32.630 --> 08:34.000
I do not presume to boast of my honor.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.750
I look to the paired swallows
circling your roof

08:35.750 --> 08:37.350
and await an auspicious day.

08:37.390 --> 08:38.440
Golden daylilies grace the northern hall;

08:38.260 --> 08:45.350
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

08:38.440 --> 08:39.440
I humbly ask that
you graciously accept this proposal.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.750
A fine jade tree awaits
in the eastern chamber;

08:40.750 --> 08:41.960
I reverently present the ceremonial geese.

08:41.960 --> 08:43.480
Shen Run, of the Shen clan of the capital,

08:43.480 --> 08:44.510
humbly bows twice.

08:44.510 --> 08:45.960
The sixteenth day of the second month,

08:45.370 --> 08:49.450
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

08:45.960 --> 08:47.560
in the eighth year of Jingxi.

08:49.470 --> 08:52.710
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

08:52.730 --> 08:58.470
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

09:01.320 --> 09:02.240
Commander,

09:04.120 --> 09:06.180
you've really thought this through?

09:07.150 --> 09:07.910
Yes.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.520
Have you considered—

09:15.600 --> 09:16.730
if we don't get along

09:17.150 --> 09:18.630
in the future,

09:19.870 --> 09:21.530
might you come to regret this?

09:21.720 --> 09:22.750
Even so,

09:23.870 --> 09:24.930
I accept that risk.

09:26.960 --> 09:28.200
Please do me the honor

09:29.040 --> 09:36.100
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

09:29.440 --> 09:30.840
of becoming my wife.

09:31.790 --> 09:32.510
I, Shen Run,

09:34.000 --> 09:36.100
will never have any complaints or regrets.

09:36.100 --> 09:42.790
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

09:42.820 --> 09:46.620
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

09:46.690 --> 09:50.120
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

09:50.180 --> 09:57.370
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

09:57.390 --> 10:04.000
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

10:04.050 --> 10:11.470
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

10:11.490 --> 10:15.200
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

10:15.230 --> 10:18.760
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

10:15.870 --> 10:17.330
[Chen family of Hengtang]

10:18.890 --> 10:25.790
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

10:25.480 --> 10:26.320
Unfilial daughter!

10:25.840 --> 10:33.490
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

10:26.790 --> 10:28.750
You are a daughter of the Xie family.

10:28.750 --> 10:30.390
Without our permission,

10:30.550 --> 10:32.000
you've pledged yourself to him

10:32.000 --> 10:33.030
and signed the marriage contract!

10:33.030 --> 10:34.390
Do you know that you've defied

10:33.510 --> 10:40.070
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

10:34.390 --> 10:36.190
all proper order and tradition?

10:37.910 --> 10:40.090
You people of the Xie family
have misunderstood.

10:40.090 --> 10:44.280
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

10:40.480 --> 10:42.140
The woman I'm seeking to marry

10:42.390 --> 10:43.390
is surnamed Chen,

10:44.080 --> 10:44.870
not Xie.

10:44.300 --> 10:47.760
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

10:46.000 --> 10:47.240
Preposterous.

10:47.630 --> 10:49.150
I'm the patriarch of the Xie family.

10:47.790 --> 10:55.020
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

10:50.120 --> 10:50.960
Qingyuan,

10:51.910 --> 10:53.910
how dare you try to change your surname.

10:53.910 --> 10:55.390
I'll give you one last chance.

10:55.040 --> 11:03.320
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

10:55.870 --> 10:56.960
Come here now,

10:57.630 --> 10:58.830
and I'll forgive you.

10:59.840 --> 11:00.390
Let's go.

11:01.080 --> 11:01.880
Let's go home.

11:06.150 --> 11:08.750
Commissioner Hu has arrived!

11:19.420 --> 11:21.740
[Hu Xing, Head of Three Commissioners]

11:22.670 --> 11:23.670
Brother!

11:25.000 --> 11:25.790
Brother.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.120
Commissioner Hu,

11:32.870 --> 11:35.730
here you are, showing up
without any warning at all.

11:54.600 --> 11:55.720
Brother,

11:56.360 --> 11:57.480
Qingyuan

11:57.870 --> 12:00.440
has already been entered into
our Xie family genealogy.

12:00.440 --> 12:02.360
Alive, she belongs to the Xie family;

12:02.360 --> 12:04.030
dead, she is a ghost of the Xie family.

12:04.030 --> 12:07.080
Today, our patriarch betrothed Qingyuan

12:07.080 --> 12:09.200
to the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang
as a concubine.

12:09.200 --> 12:11.120
It should've been a joyous occasion—

12:11.120 --> 12:12.790
a double blessing.

12:13.960 --> 12:16.550
But unexpectedly, Commander Shen

12:17.000 --> 12:18.660
barged into the wedding hall.

12:18.790 --> 12:20.320
Not only did he snatch Qingyuan away,

12:20.320 --> 12:22.520
but he also tried to change her surname.

12:22.870 --> 12:26.150
It's simply... too much for us to bear.

12:26.840 --> 12:29.320
I hope you'll stand up for us, Brother.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.270
Such a thing happened?

12:45.790 --> 12:47.990
Where is the gift I bought for my sister?

12:58.390 --> 12:59.480
Your favorite

13:00.120 --> 13:01.320
when you were little.

13:07.600 --> 13:10.860
Thank you for always
keeping me in your thoughts, Brother.

13:17.840 --> 13:18.960
Commander Shen,

13:20.120 --> 13:23.380
looks like your marriage
won't be going through after all.

13:27.120 --> 13:28.600
I've long heard

13:28.840 --> 13:31.000
that you have an extraordinary presence,
Commissioner Hu.

13:31.000 --> 13:32.640
Now that I've seen you today,

13:32.670 --> 13:34.630
you indeed live up to your reputation.

13:34.630 --> 13:36.230
I'm determined to marry her.

13:36.600 --> 13:37.750
You, a mere commissioner—

13:37.750 --> 13:39.960
do you really think
you can stop the Palace Guards

13:39.960 --> 13:41.550
and me by yourself?

13:48.270 --> 13:49.200
I came here today

13:49.320 --> 13:50.840
without a single soldier.

13:51.240 --> 13:52.370
How could I possibly

13:52.630 --> 13:55.630
stop the Palace Guards,
who stormed through Hengtang

13:56.150 --> 13:57.790
with such might

13:58.440 --> 13:59.840
just days ago?

14:13.620 --> 14:14.710
[Memorial; Your subject, Li Shaoqun]

14:22.810 --> 14:24.210
[Increase pay to stabilize the army.]
[The wounded shall receive double pay for life.]

14:26.390 --> 14:26.850
Well...

14:28.390 --> 14:29.390
Commissioner Hu,

14:29.390 --> 14:31.150
isn't this the memorial

14:31.390 --> 14:35.120
I submitted to the imperial court
regarding soldiers' pay some time ago?

14:35.120 --> 14:36.980
How did it come to be in your hands?

14:41.000 --> 14:42.260
The Marquis of Danyang

14:42.630 --> 14:45.080
wants to refine the armor for the troops

14:45.270 --> 14:48.080
in his camp and raise their pay,

14:48.840 --> 14:52.670
so His Lordship has repeatedly
requested funds.

14:54.030 --> 14:55.030
As luck would have it,

14:55.030 --> 14:55.870
this memorial

14:56.320 --> 14:57.120
just

14:57.910 --> 14:59.910
landed right on my desk.

15:05.870 --> 15:06.670
But

15:07.390 --> 15:08.670
as you all know,

15:09.030 --> 15:11.320
the court has many demands for funding.

15:13.000 --> 15:14.860
I'm also in a difficult position.

15:15.600 --> 15:16.750
But if

15:17.510 --> 15:18.910
both of my nieces

15:19.360 --> 15:20.910
marry your son,

15:21.240 --> 15:23.480
wouldn't we be even closer?

15:24.440 --> 15:24.840
Yes.

15:26.670 --> 15:28.360
Then, whether in the court's interest
or my own,

15:28.360 --> 15:30.240
I'll approve it, even though we're kin.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.550
Let people say whatever they please.

15:32.910 --> 15:35.480
You can be sure

15:35.910 --> 15:37.370
I'll put your needs first.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.630
Commissioner Hu,

15:41.670 --> 15:42.910
are you trying to use

15:43.320 --> 15:44.840
the soldiers' pay

15:45.390 --> 15:46.510
to threaten me?

15:53.360 --> 15:54.220
Your Lordship,

15:54.450 --> 15:59.220
I'm genuinely concerned for your sake.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.910
You've

16:04.600 --> 16:06.530
guarded this place for many years.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.900
Your soldiers' equipment

16:09.150 --> 16:11.080
should've been replaced long ago.

16:11.200 --> 16:13.630
During the last raid
by the northern bandits,

16:13.630 --> 16:16.510
many soldiers lost their lives
because their armor

16:16.510 --> 16:17.510
was too fragile.

16:17.840 --> 16:19.200
If we don't replace
the military equipment,

16:19.200 --> 16:21.390
the soldiers will lose their morale.

16:21.720 --> 16:25.030
How will we
safeguard the peace of the people?

16:26.550 --> 16:27.910
We might as well disband

16:28.440 --> 16:29.480
your army!

16:38.360 --> 16:38.960
Soldiers!

16:39.600 --> 16:40.360
Yes, sir!

16:58.010 --> 16:59.050
Commander Shen,

16:59.550 --> 17:02.390
you're a guest here in Hengtang.

17:02.960 --> 17:03.840
I should've

17:04.400 --> 17:06.800
shown you proper hospitality long ago.

17:07.270 --> 17:08.470
Today's show of force

17:08.589 --> 17:09.790
is the welcoming gift

17:09.920 --> 17:12.109
I've prepared especially for you.

17:13.200 --> 17:15.000
You should be able to see clearly

17:15.829 --> 17:18.030
how we receive guests here in Hengtang.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.550
You're a clever man.

17:20.270 --> 17:22.400
Do you understand?

17:39.440 --> 17:40.780
Soldiers,

17:41.030 --> 17:43.960
you've faithfully followed
His Lordship for years!

17:44.030 --> 17:46.350
You don't want to
see him humiliated, do you?

17:46.350 --> 17:48.010
Then what are you waiting for?

17:48.510 --> 17:49.770
Get the concubine back

17:50.240 --> 17:52.400
for Young Master Li!

17:57.060 --> 17:57.960
Don't worry.

17:58.550 --> 17:59.640
You're my wife.

17:59.920 --> 18:02.250
I won't let your reputation be tarnished.

18:08.350 --> 18:09.750
I'd like to see who dares.

18:21.110 --> 18:22.640
Here's the imperial edict!

18:22.720 --> 18:24.680
Lay down your arms, remove your armor,

18:24.680 --> 18:26.010
and kneel to receive it!

18:34.070 --> 18:34.790
What?

18:35.270 --> 18:38.470
Are you going to defy
an imperial edict, Commissioner Hu?

18:52.720 --> 18:53.450
This subject

18:54.750 --> 18:55.880
receives the edict.

19:07.480 --> 19:09.200
By the Mandate of Heaven, I decree:

19:09.200 --> 19:10.790
Xie Qingyuan,
fourth daughter of the Xie family,

19:10.790 --> 19:12.000
is pure and virtuous.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.640
It grieves this throne that legitimate

19:13.640 --> 19:15.550
and concubine-born daughters
are worlds apart.

19:15.550 --> 19:18.200
The whole Xie clan allowed their servants
to abuse the lonely girl,

19:18.200 --> 19:19.350
which is truly a grave violation
of human decency.

19:19.350 --> 19:21.960
Now, Shen Run,
Commander of the Palace Guard,

19:21.960 --> 19:23.350
has distinguished himself
through meritorious service

19:23.350 --> 19:25.480
and has submitted his heartfelt petition
before the throne.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.960
This throne, moved by his plea,

19:26.960 --> 19:28.350
grants marriage between Shen and Qingyuan.

19:28.350 --> 19:30.550
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
shall select an auspicious date

19:30.550 --> 19:32.110
and prepare the betrothal rites
according to protocol.

19:32.110 --> 19:34.240
Xie Qingyuan shall be removed
from the Xie family register.

19:34.240 --> 19:36.550
Her name shall be struck
from the Xie genealogy,

19:36.550 --> 19:37.830
and she shall return to the Chen family.

19:37.830 --> 19:40.510
She shall be granted the title of
Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

19:40.510 --> 19:42.350
together with 100 qing of fertile land

19:42.350 --> 19:44.010
and golden phoenix hairpins.

19:44.160 --> 19:46.220
Spring, in the eighth year of Jingxi.

20:18.350 --> 20:19.280
Commander Shen.

20:20.640 --> 20:23.070
You truly are a trusted confidant
close to the throne.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.470
I honestly didn't expect

20:24.720 --> 20:27.960
you to be so favored by the Emperor.

20:31.110 --> 20:32.430
Likewise.

20:34.310 --> 20:36.440
I didn't want things to come to this.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.590
But you

20:38.880 --> 20:40.070
left me no choice.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.400
Since that's how things stand,

20:42.400 --> 20:44.400
and today is an auspicious day,

20:45.830 --> 20:46.880
I might as well

20:46.880 --> 20:49.610
borrow the wedding arrangements already

20:49.790 --> 20:52.270
set up here for my own marriage.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.960
You have the imperial edict to shield you;

20:57.960 --> 21:00.590
I have no objections.

21:05.000 --> 21:09.310
But a wedding without elders present

21:09.960 --> 21:14.070
will invite the wrath of Heaven.

21:17.110 --> 21:18.970
Hurry, we can't afford to be late.

21:22.550 --> 21:23.640
My goodness!

21:23.640 --> 21:25.430
Look at this spectacle!

21:41.920 --> 21:42.960
This chair...

21:45.790 --> 21:47.240
I-I'm not late, am I?

21:48.030 --> 21:48.550
Well...

21:52.550 --> 21:53.550
Let's begin.

21:54.640 --> 21:55.000
Okay.

21:56.310 --> 21:57.440
Bride and groom,

21:57.550 --> 21:59.030
bow to Heaven and Earth!

22:03.590 --> 22:04.640
Bow!

22:10.070 --> 22:11.510
Second bow to the elder—

22:12.790 --> 22:15.050
may you enjoy family happiness forever!

22:20.640 --> 22:21.680
Bow!

22:30.510 --> 22:31.590
Great.

22:33.680 --> 22:35.610
Bride and groom, bow to each other—

22:35.830 --> 22:38.030
may blessing and peace be with you both!

22:56.790 --> 22:57.920
The ceremony is complete!

22:57.920 --> 23:02.720
Great!

24:02.350 --> 24:04.980
Well, I came at a bad time.

24:06.920 --> 24:09.790
But I wanted you to try

24:09.790 --> 24:11.790
the osmanthus candies I just made.

24:11.880 --> 24:12.640
These were

24:12.640 --> 24:14.680
her favorite when she was little.

24:14.680 --> 24:15.830
She used to sneak them all the time,

24:15.830 --> 24:17.480
and I caught her every time.

24:19.640 --> 24:21.440
These are your wedding candies.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.480
Make sure you eat them, okay?

24:29.920 --> 24:30.720
You two,

24:30.920 --> 24:32.150
what's going on here?

24:33.480 --> 24:35.350
Why are you sitting
so formally and stiffly?

24:35.350 --> 24:36.890
Why so tense?

24:37.240 --> 24:39.440
You two are married now.

24:39.440 --> 24:42.310
Why are you still shy
like a pair of children?

24:43.720 --> 24:45.160
Seriously.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.610
Seeing you two finally married

24:49.960 --> 24:51.070
makes me happier

24:51.070 --> 24:52.960
than anything.

24:53.640 --> 24:55.070
Everyone says that

24:55.590 --> 24:59.250
by changing her red-and-blue wedding robes
to a blood-red cloak,

24:59.480 --> 25:03.160
you turned a marriage
above her station into one below it, Yan.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.590
But I think,

25:04.960 --> 25:06.350
in today's wedding,

25:06.720 --> 25:07.270
Yan, you

25:07.830 --> 25:09.360
gave her plenty of dignity.

25:17.200 --> 25:19.680
It's... Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

25:20.200 --> 25:20.790
right?

25:23.480 --> 25:25.010
Second-Rank Lady of Honor!

25:25.240 --> 25:27.640
That's certainly something to boast about!

25:27.640 --> 25:29.880
I mean, it's such an honor!

25:34.000 --> 25:34.800
From now on...

25:36.400 --> 25:38.110
I'll have plenty to brag about

25:38.110 --> 25:39.510
to all the neighbors.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.720
I almost forgot

25:44.720 --> 25:46.180
the most important thing—

25:48.000 --> 25:48.830
I still need to

25:48.830 --> 25:50.400
go make the bed for you.

26:26.720 --> 26:27.590
My Lady,

26:27.960 --> 26:30.890
how about I help you
take off the phoenix crown first?

26:44.070 --> 26:45.350
I'm really here.

26:47.510 --> 26:51.310
I've become the Heir's Consort
of the Marquis of Danyang household.

26:52.640 --> 26:54.270
I really married Chunzhi.

26:55.680 --> 26:58.480
It's already past midnight,

26:58.550 --> 27:00.150
and the Heir hasn't come yet.

27:00.440 --> 27:02.440
Should we send someone to fetch him?

27:04.720 --> 27:06.960
He must be caught up with the guests.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.830
He's the Heir,

27:10.720 --> 27:12.320
and today is his wedding day.

27:13.310 --> 27:16.710
Naturally, everyone wants to
offer their congratulations.

27:17.200 --> 27:18.110
But...

27:19.000 --> 27:22.160
But after everything, this marriage
hasn't exactly gone smoothly.

27:22.160 --> 27:24.830
What if he doesn't come at all tonight?

27:40.030 --> 27:41.560
If he doesn't come today...

27:43.400 --> 27:45.130
then I'll wait until tomorrow.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.400
I have a...

27:56.240 --> 27:57.550
a whole lifetime...

28:00.440 --> 28:01.510
to wait.

28:05.590 --> 28:06.400
My Lady.

28:45.030 --> 28:45.720
Che,

28:47.400 --> 28:49.260
I know what you're worried about.

28:50.550 --> 28:52.720
You're worried
that I've forgotten my mission—

28:52.720 --> 28:54.450
forgotten what we set out to do.

28:55.680 --> 28:56.740
Good that you know.

28:57.960 --> 29:00.310
Feng En has already reported
that your lovely wife

29:00.310 --> 29:02.310
intends to move against Xie Shu.

29:03.400 --> 29:05.660
This is not what His Majesty wants to see.

29:06.920 --> 29:07.640
And you—

29:09.000 --> 29:13.000
you actually asked for an edict
to snatch her in a moment of desperation.

29:13.590 --> 29:15.350
Are you afraid
that His Majesty won't notice

29:15.350 --> 29:17.680
that you also want to
move against Xie Shu?

29:23.510 --> 29:24.640
Do you know

29:25.310 --> 29:27.700
how afraid I've been every day?

29:28.310 --> 29:29.680
Afraid that one day, we'd never be able

29:29.680 --> 29:31.510
to finish what we set out to do!

29:35.750 --> 29:37.750
What is it that we truly set out to do?

29:39.310 --> 29:40.510
Along the way,

29:42.110 --> 29:44.170
how long were we destitute refugees,

29:45.590 --> 29:47.250
how many places did we flee to,

29:48.070 --> 29:49.670
and how many people helped us

29:50.830 --> 29:52.430
so that we could escape death

29:52.830 --> 29:54.160
and live to see this day?

29:58.310 --> 29:59.790
We've seen so much hatred,

30:01.350 --> 30:02.590
so much vengeance.

30:07.880 --> 30:09.740
After everything we've endured,

30:12.350 --> 30:13.510
we're no longer

30:15.550 --> 30:17.950
seeking revenge merely for the Shen family

30:19.590 --> 30:21.030
but for the whole realm.

30:22.720 --> 30:24.030
I believe in our father

30:27.070 --> 30:29.330
and in every soul the candles represent.

30:31.030 --> 30:32.430
This was their wish.

30:43.900 --> 30:49.670
[Shen Residence]

30:57.550 --> 31:02.090
[Shen Residence]

31:17.480 --> 31:20.890
[Shen Residence]

32:20.640 --> 32:21.400
Nine years.

32:23.160 --> 32:24.820
Since I returned to Hengtang,

32:25.240 --> 32:26.970
I've walked every corner of it,

32:27.480 --> 32:29.880
yet I've never dared to
push open this door.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.680
If it weren't for you,

32:33.680 --> 32:36.140
I don't think I would've ever
returned here.

32:41.480 --> 32:42.350
I never told you

32:42.350 --> 32:43.950
why I have to protect Xie Shu.

32:45.720 --> 32:48.070
But when I saw you were about to
marry another man,

32:48.070 --> 32:49.270
I couldn't accept it.

32:51.680 --> 32:53.540
So I asked His Majesty for an edict

32:54.720 --> 32:56.030
to keep you by my side.

32:56.750 --> 32:57.510
Now,

32:58.680 --> 33:00.200
I can tell you everything.

33:01.310 --> 33:02.830
My resolve for vengeance

33:03.920 --> 33:06.120
never wavered, not for a single moment.

33:06.350 --> 33:08.240
Nor could 9 years of my efforts

33:09.000 --> 33:11.060
be erased by a single imperial edict.

33:11.880 --> 33:12.790
It's because I know

33:12.790 --> 33:15.050
I still have more important things to do.

33:15.590 --> 33:17.250
That's why I have no choice but

33:17.880 --> 33:20.010
to spare Xie Shu's life a while longer—

33:20.480 --> 33:21.340
causing you...

33:23.550 --> 33:26.270
and the 72 deceased members of our family

33:27.880 --> 33:29.210
to wait a little longer.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.240
This courtyard

33:35.510 --> 33:38.710
was once filled with magnolia trees
that my mother loved.

33:38.750 --> 33:42.080
She loved the season
when the flowers bloomed and then fell.

33:42.440 --> 33:43.640
We could smell

33:45.030 --> 33:45.960
their fragrance

33:46.830 --> 33:48.510
before we even reached home.

33:52.200 --> 33:52.750
Until that day,

33:52.750 --> 33:54.550
my father and I went to your home.

33:57.070 --> 33:59.070
Before the flowers could even fall,

34:00.440 --> 34:01.790
our family fell first.

34:10.150 --> 34:12.110
Our entire household was wiped out.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.440
And the root of it all...

34:15.880 --> 34:18.010
was one new policy my father proposed.

34:19.710 --> 34:21.480
Displaced refugees could be resettled,

34:21.480 --> 34:22.880
wasteland reclaimed,

34:22.880 --> 34:24.280
commoners granted land,

34:24.440 --> 34:26.510
and taxes and labor duties
fairly apportioned.

34:26.510 --> 34:28.760
All these entrenched abuses—
from noble families concealing land

34:28.760 --> 34:30.889
to wealthy households evading taxes—

34:30.920 --> 34:32.120
could be eradicated.

34:32.960 --> 34:34.630
The power held by officials

34:34.920 --> 34:36.580
and the fate of common people—

34:36.880 --> 34:39.030
could all be reckoned anew.

34:39.960 --> 34:41.420
But, My Lord, your reforms

34:41.440 --> 34:43.440
will surely offend all of Hengtang.

34:43.480 --> 34:43.880
No,

34:44.480 --> 34:46.340
they will offend the whole world.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.840
Knowing the world carries
such deep-rooted ailments,

34:47.840 --> 34:49.840
how can we just live on
in comfortable indifference?

34:49.840 --> 34:51.730
If it's destined that some must die

34:51.730 --> 34:53.190
for the new policy to move forward,

34:53.190 --> 34:56.650
I, Shen Zhibai, am willing to
be the first to give my life for it!

35:05.510 --> 35:06.760
The new policy

35:07.710 --> 35:08.760
of equalization

35:09.480 --> 35:13.190
shall survey the land, equalize taxes,

35:13.550 --> 35:15.760
reform the corvée,
and establish a fair grain levy,

35:15.760 --> 35:18.320
thereby easing the burden on the people.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.760
"Survey the land, equalize taxes,

35:20.760 --> 35:21.590
reform the corvée,
and establish a fair grain levy,

35:21.590 --> 35:23.190
thereby easing the burden on the people."

35:23.190 --> 35:25.650
Until the day he died,
my father kept saying,

35:26.230 --> 35:28.480
"When the flowers fall
and nourish the earth,

35:28.480 --> 35:30.740
next year they'll bloom more brightly."

35:31.070 --> 35:32.280
He believed his death

35:33.280 --> 35:35.280
was like a seed planted in the earth.

35:35.400 --> 35:36.460
Once it blossomed,

35:37.880 --> 35:41.080
it might put an end to
Hengtang's endless cycle of famine.

35:45.670 --> 35:46.840
But after he died,

35:48.590 --> 35:49.960
no one remembered him

35:51.880 --> 35:53.540
or even wanted to mention him.

35:54.800 --> 35:56.030
The seed he planted

35:58.150 --> 36:00.410
seemed to have died in Hengtang long ago.

36:01.800 --> 36:04.260
Of course, I hate those
who caused his death.

36:05.190 --> 36:07.120
But I understand even more clearly

36:09.150 --> 36:12.080
that fulfilling my father's dying wish
matters more

36:14.070 --> 36:15.670
than destroying my enemies.

36:19.070 --> 36:19.880
I believe

36:21.960 --> 36:24.220
this is what he would
want me to do as well.

36:25.960 --> 36:27.710
I chose this path

36:29.360 --> 36:31.360
not simply because he was my father,

36:31.960 --> 36:32.960
but because...

36:34.510 --> 36:35.440
he was right.

36:40.800 --> 36:42.660
I should've realized it long ago.

36:42.760 --> 36:44.020
Whether you're Yan Rui

36:44.630 --> 36:45.590
or Shen Run,

36:46.760 --> 36:48.480
whether you're a corrupt official

36:48.480 --> 36:49.810
or a ruthless enforcer,

36:50.360 --> 36:51.550
beneath that mask,

36:52.440 --> 36:53.840
you are still the same man

36:54.230 --> 36:57.550
determined to transform Hengtang.

36:59.000 --> 37:00.260
You've never changed.

37:00.440 --> 37:01.840
You're still the Shen Run

37:02.000 --> 37:04.400
I waited for 9 years in the ruined temple—

37:04.880 --> 37:06.630
the one who saved me as a child

37:07.150 --> 37:08.840
and gave me hope to live.

37:15.400 --> 37:16.190
Now that

37:16.880 --> 37:17.880
we are married,

37:18.590 --> 37:19.440
we are family.

37:20.480 --> 37:21.550
The road you have chosen

37:21.550 --> 37:22.550
is mine as well.

37:23.230 --> 37:23.880
I think

37:24.590 --> 37:27.110
this is also
what my mother would want to see.

37:28.110 --> 37:31.240
This is far more important
than our personal vendettas.

37:31.680 --> 37:38.860
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

37:34.960 --> 37:36.360
We got married so hastily

37:37.550 --> 37:38.400
that I never had the time

37:38.400 --> 37:39.960
to get us a new residence—

37:38.890 --> 37:45.510
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

37:40.550 --> 37:42.150
a place we could call our own.

37:45.610 --> 37:53.250
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

37:46.000 --> 37:48.880
Why not build our home right here?

37:53.370 --> 38:00.670
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

37:58.930 --> 38:01.800
[Shen Residence]

38:00.810 --> 38:07.740
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

38:07.840 --> 38:18.020
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

38:18.200 --> 38:25.380
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

38:18.880 --> 38:19.480
Stop.

38:22.710 --> 38:23.770
You're a grown man,

38:24.630 --> 38:26.440
yet you don't even have the courage
to enter your own home?

38:25.400 --> 38:32.570
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

38:29.880 --> 38:31.760
Once I've accomplished
what I set out to do,

38:31.760 --> 38:33.150
I'll naturally come back
to console our family's spirits.

38:32.600 --> 38:36.180
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

38:34.190 --> 38:34.800
I know.

38:36.200 --> 38:39.820
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

38:36.800 --> 38:38.600
Except for you and your brother,

38:39.070 --> 38:41.190
everyone else in your family
died 9 years ago.

38:39.850 --> 38:46.260
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

38:41.920 --> 38:42.630
But now...

38:45.920 --> 38:47.650
your family has a third member.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.360
From now on,

38:52.000 --> 38:53.860
you'll have more family members.

38:54.280 --> 38:55.610
And this Shen Residence

38:56.440 --> 38:58.040
will take on a whole new look.

38:58.800 --> 39:01.110
But if you never dare to
walk through this door,

39:01.110 --> 39:02.150
this courtyard

39:01.550 --> 39:08.020
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

39:02.920 --> 39:05.070
will remain forever
as it lives in your memory—

39:05.070 --> 39:06.360
soaked in blood.

39:08.130 --> 39:15.290
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

39:15.470 --> 39:22.830
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

39:22.940 --> 39:30.110
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

39:30.220 --> 39:37.520
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

39:37.110 --> 39:37.710
Brother.

39:37.640 --> 39:46.830
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

39:41.550 --> 39:42.210
Let me do it.

39:48.940 --> 39:55.560
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

40:02.280 --> 40:05.480
Congratulations on your wedding,
Commander.

40:07.840 --> 40:08.800
Though

40:09.840 --> 40:11.590
I wonder if you've been so dazzled
by your beautiful bride

40:11.590 --> 40:12.920
that you've lost your senses.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.480
His Majesty granting your personal wish

40:14.480 --> 40:16.710
was already an extraordinary act of grace.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.400
Yet you've

40:19.030 --> 40:20.990
leaked his top-secret mission

40:21.020 --> 40:22.670
to your new wife.

40:23.630 --> 40:25.480
Revealing a confidential imperial edict

40:25.480 --> 40:26.680
is a capital offense!

40:30.110 --> 40:30.760
Shen Run,

40:32.070 --> 40:33.800
I've already made a concession.

40:33.800 --> 40:35.460
As long as Chen Qingyuan dies,

40:35.880 --> 40:38.140
I'll pretend none of this ever happened.

40:38.320 --> 40:39.550
What good would

40:40.320 --> 40:41.480
killing Chen Qingyuan do for us

40:41.480 --> 40:42.920
or for His Majesty's

40:43.320 --> 40:44.280
plans?

40:45.440 --> 40:46.900
Are you defying the edict?

40:47.230 --> 40:47.840
Feng En,

40:49.230 --> 40:50.670
you and I fought together
in the Northern Frontier

40:50.670 --> 40:51.960
for years,

40:52.400 --> 40:53.730
through life and death.

40:54.070 --> 40:56.230
Are you really going to
turn your sword against me?

40:56.230 --> 40:57.400
I'm not like you.

40:58.280 --> 41:00.340
I know very well that I'm just a blade.

41:00.510 --> 41:01.630
In the Northern Frontier,

41:01.630 --> 41:03.510
I was the general's sharpest weapon.

41:03.510 --> 41:04.370
In the capital,

41:04.800 --> 41:06.200
I'm His Majesty's blade.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.710
Whoever I serve,

41:08.150 --> 41:09.010
my blade points

41:09.360 --> 41:10.670
where they direct.

41:10.920 --> 41:12.840
Even with brotherly bonds between us,

41:12.840 --> 41:15.070
when the moment comes
that I must take your life,

41:15.070 --> 41:17.320
I'll show no mercy whatsoever.

41:27.110 --> 41:28.970
As long as it's not Chen Qingyuan.

41:31.230 --> 41:32.430
If you want to kill me,

41:33.400 --> 41:34.000
so be it.
